  "prompt_text": "Continue the given text:\nFollowing World War III, all the nations of the world agreed to 50 years of strict isolation from one another in order to prevent additional conflicts. 50 years later, the United States comes out of exile, only to learn that no one else went into isolation.\n\n\n\nThe United States is now the only superpower in the world, and the only country that has access to nuclear weapons. It's also the only country that has the ability to travel to space. The world is now a powder keg, and the U.S. is the only one with a match.",
